{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous Coffee Machine 2</strong> is a strange interactive visual novel and fictional simulation where you stand across from a mysterious girl and an unassuming coffee vending machine capable of producing anything you type, no matter how impossible it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/92b6951f8120759bc57806f5feba24d1.poster.avif?t=1773234679\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/92b6951f8120759bc57806f5feba24d1.webm?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/92b6951f8120759bc57806f5feba24d1.mp4?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn\u2019t tell you who she is, why she's there, or what's the deal with the coffee machine. All she asks is that you type a word\u2014any word\u2014and press the button. The machine will respond. It always does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type in <strong>&quot;coffee&quot;</strong>, and you\u2019ll receive exactly that.<br>Type <strong>&quot;blood&quot;</strong>\u2014yeah, sure.<br>Type <strong>&quot;saliva&quot;</strong>\u2014You probably shouldn\u2019t, but it can do that too.<br>Type\u00a0<strong>&quot;death&quot;?</strong> You can try.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/10599ebc5048bf1420f831ca9162cc2f.poster.avif?t=1773234679\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/10599ebc5048bf1420f831ca9162cc2f.webm?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/10599ebc5048bf1420f831ca9162cc2f.mp4?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay is simple:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type a word.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cup appears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who drinks: the girl, or you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something happens. Or doesn\u2019t. Or waits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She reacts differently depending on what you give her. Sometimes she smiles. Sometimes she winces. Sometimes she vanishes, only to return changed. Sometimes she doesn\u2019t come back at all. And if <i>you</i> choose to drink, the machine reacts to you instead. Don\u2019t expect a fair trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/366d39c4e93ce129876a6078efb50a11.poster.avif?t=1773234679\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/366d39c4e93ce129876a6078efb50a11.webm?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/366d39c4e93ce129876a6078efb50a11.mp4?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no instructions. No quests. No markers to follow. You\u2019re not told what the machine is or what it wants. You\u2019re left to experiment. Test words. Try feelings. Push the machine. Break it. Or let it break you.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/2ed142d1b355d73162dc774e19f561b74d5c7e36.jpg"},{"name":"Seeker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/7d59daa03e076b394da97ff5b3e45d88acae8d5e.jpg"},{"name":"Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/38f01025ee3df4033e4dbaaa4276de532ec1dea3.jpg"},{"name":"Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/916a234f38917f8221d1e0b91a958d5a04a7b568.jpg"},{"name":"Analyst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/456fd2a3982691bbd8528e9ddd9de286c32405b3.jpg"},{"name":"Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/b3d7b614d1e7b1e34d0fcd222db06117a9755f8f.jpg"},{"name":"Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/f8906b8c9be92f36d846ffd707f5467546d8d434.jpg"},{"name":"Archivist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/77ae6974aed90cbe2e2ebe5fd955bdcb669b5d9c.jpg"},{"name":"Mortal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/b359ad1ba91a7729f055463ca0682c4c434d3cc2.jpg"},{"name":"Unhuman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3797340/8357b887764cbc948c899742bb8cbca822deb592.jpg"}],"total":128},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3797340?t=1773234679","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/c6a6c30eef15b0ff1e4330c9e736bb27d97f0fb8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773234679","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/e3c07f776bfeef54e6879ef72a5cff46eb5cdeb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773234679","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/e3c07f776bfeef54e6879ef72a5cff46eb5cdeb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773234679","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game contains extremely disturbing imagery and scenes as part of certain gameplay outcomes, such as gore, nudity, violence, death, and body horror."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anomalous Coffee Machine 2</strong> is a strange interactive visual novel and fictional simulation where you stand across from a mysterious girl and an unassuming coffee vending machine capable of producing anything you type, no matter how impossible it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/92b6951f8120759bc57806f5feba24d1.poster.avif?t=1773234679\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/92b6951f8120759bc57806f5feba24d1.webm?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/92b6951f8120759bc57806f5feba24d1.mp4?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She doesn\u2019t tell you who she is, why she's there, or what's the deal with the coffee machine. All she asks is that you type a word\u2014any word\u2014and press the button. The machine will respond. It always does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type in <strong>&quot;coffee&quot;</strong>, and you\u2019ll receive exactly that.<br>Type <strong>&quot;blood&quot;</strong>\u2014yeah, sure.<br>Type <strong>&quot;saliva&quot;</strong>\u2014You probably shouldn\u2019t, but it can do that too.<br>Type\u00a0<strong>&quot;death&quot;?</strong> You can try.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/10599ebc5048bf1420f831ca9162cc2f.poster.avif?t=1773234679\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/10599ebc5048bf1420f831ca9162cc2f.webm?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/10599ebc5048bf1420f831ca9162cc2f.mp4?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay is simple:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type a word.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cup appears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who drinks: the girl, or you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something happens. Or doesn\u2019t. Or waits.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She reacts differently depending on what you give her. Sometimes she smiles. Sometimes she winces. Sometimes she vanishes, only to return changed. Sometimes she doesn\u2019t come back at all. And if <i>you</i> choose to drink, the machine reacts to you instead. Don\u2019t expect a fair trade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/366d39c4e93ce129876a6078efb50a11.poster.avif?t=1773234679\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/366d39c4e93ce129876a6078efb50a11.webm?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/extras/366d39c4e93ce129876a6078efb50a11.mp4?t=1773234679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no instructions. No quests. No markers to follow. You\u2019re not told what the machine is or what it wants. You\u2019re left to experiment. Test words. Try feelings. Push the machine. Break it. Or let it break you.</p>","developers":["HoruBrain Interactive"],"dlc":[3875100],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797340/b57da816c2bb5862e1cad31bdf34fe18d4137178/header.jpg?t=1773234679","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797340/777848767/4278242be2b51797fe2db2497c535eb188f57e95/1765193428/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765198393","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797340/777848767/4278242be2b51797fe2db2497c535eb188f57e95/1765193428/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765198393","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797340/777848767/4278242be2b51797fe2db2497c535eb188f57e95/1765193428/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765198393","id":257245103,"name":"Final Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257245103/48edf524ce5df471bec462328a80d29b334e47f2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765198393"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797340/167139270/68845a009176d7ea9f37519aa2aa325d185669a8/1750177778/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765198395","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797340/167139270/68845a009176d7ea9f37519aa2aa325d185669a8/1750177778/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765198395","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3797340/167139270/68845a009176d7ea9f37519aa2aa325d185669a8/1750177778/hls_264_m